{"type": "say", "text": "Good afternoon, everyone. I'd like to get started on reviewing the draft exhibition plan for our district's annual public art exhibition at the central library. As you all know, six student portfolios have been selected, and before anything goes public, I need to review the draft protocol with the visual arts teacher and district registrar and give my final approval. I have the draft in front of me — it proposes displaying the work in the central library foyer, publishing an online gallery, labeling pieces with students' full names, and returning or discarding the original portfolios after the exhibition. I'd like to go through each of these elements carefully. Who would like to start — do we have any initial concerns about the plan as drafted?"}
```

