{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I have some serious concerns with the draft plan as it currently stands. When I verified the consent forms for all six selected portfolios during this week's portfolio selection, I found that the forms permit public display only in a staffed indoor gallery, require student initials rather than full names on labels, and prohibit online publication. I have not yet transferred those restrictions into the draft plan, so the current draft — which proposes displaying work in the foyer, publishing an online gallery, and labeling pieces with full names — conflicts with what the consent forms actually allow."}
```

